ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  In 2nd seat you need to be reasonably disciplined when preempting^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  The Law of Total Tricks says it is right to be in 3-level with a 9 card fit^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Fine print of  'Rule of 20'^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  When Hearts are trump Kickback RKCB is preferred^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Fine print of  DONT^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|


