UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In 2nd seat you need to be reasonably disciplined when preempting. So West knows that East has a hand with a nice heart suit and at least 5 or 6 points. Therefore, with 21 HCP, he knows his side should be in game and 4@H is likely to be their best spot. Give partner as little as six hearts to the AQ, and game has good plays.|
PG| ***** 13 ***** |


