UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So note that the absence of spade intermediates (tens and nines) made the spade suit very iffy. @SA8xxxx is not nearly as good a suit as @SA109xxx. With @SA109xxx he might only have 1 spade loser instead of 2.|
